            "review_title": "Review at Saigon Vieux Coffee.",
            "review_text": "TheSaintKing\nSingapore, Singapore152 contributions\n0\nFriendly Neighbourhood Cafe\nMar 2018 • Solo\nOne of the restaurants in Cafe apartments where you get Vegan food. Now the staff do not speak much english , so i had to tell them about the food restrictions with sign language and the order went terribly wrong :-)\n\nBut hey were very helpful and got me another dish cooked from scratch while i enjoyed the view of the walking street from their balcony. The coffee was great, the interior decorations were fine.\n\nFood was tasty and $ cheap. Very much recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 24, 2018",
