            "review_title": "Review at Saigon Vieux Coffee.",
            "review_text": "GBaller\nMalmö, Sweden227 contributions\n0\nHole in the wall value and good food\nJan 2018 • Business\nStumbled in to this cafe, as we were wandering around a funky old building in HCM City. Main thing here is the taste of the food, and the relatively low cost of it. The pineapple or seafood rice, tofu dishes, and garlic morning glory were very tasty. In the evening, when the heat/sun has gone down, sitting by the outside balcony provides a good view of hustle and bustle of HCM City a couple of floors below. Service is friendly and quick. Worth the visit!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 22, 2018",
