            "review_text": "SaigonExile\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nA very nice find!\nDec 2017 • Couples\nSaigon Vieux was actually not the choice of the day but we stumbled upon it. I must say, the food was very good (enjoyed immensely the Pomelo Salad) though the service is somewhat slooooooow...lol\n\nI would recommend for sure. Every dish my wife and I had was very good and very inexpensive!\n\nDo not take the lift no matter how lazy you are....you'll get hit with a 3000d charge for using it lol....\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 20, 2017",
