            "review_text": "Belinda W\nKuala Lumpur398 contributions\n0\nGreat place to visit at least once\nMay 2017\nIt's wheelchair accessible but you need to pay for the elevator to go up! There're a total of 8th floors altogether with a mixture of some shops, cafe & bars.\n\nI was here just for some coffee. I had ordered Ice Vietnamese Coffee with milk which should never go wrong but it's totally diluted! The staff is not well versed in English and had misunderstood us several times.\n\nIt's a good experience to check the entire Cafe Apartment if you're here in Ho Chi Minh City but if you're a coffee lover, maybe try others next time if you're here.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 30, 2017",
