            "review_title": "Review at Saigon Vieux Coffee.",
            "review_text": "Kris M\n22 contributions\n0\nNice view with poor service\nMar 2017 • Friends\nNicely located with the view on Walking Street of Saigonand great view to iconic Bitexco Tower. However the service isn't very good. I received my food after 45 minutes and it was not prepared here but ordered by staff from somewhere else (no wonder the high prices). My carrot juice was mixed with water. If you just want a coffee or beer it's a good choice though.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 22, 2017",
